<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n87320" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">προεξ-ανίσταμαι</span></b> , 
			Pass.
		, with aor. 2, pf. and plpf.
		
			Act.
		, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>rise before</i> or
				<i>first,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				9.62
			</span></i>; <i>rouse oneself beforehand,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				D.
				18.163
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				J.
				<u>AJ</u>
				18.6.10
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. τῷ πολέμῳ</span>”
				<i>make war first,</i>
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					<u>Rom.</u>
					16
				</span></i>
			: c. gen., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. τοῦ τέλους</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Lib.
					<u>Or.</u>
					51.4
				</span></i>
			; <i>to be roused before,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὼ χεῖρε π. τῶν ὀφθαλμῶν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Them.
					<u>Or.</u>
					17.216c
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> in a race,
				<i>start before</i> the signal is given, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οἱ προεξανιστάμενοι ῥαπίζονται</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdt.
					8.59
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				<u>Them.</u>
				11
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-αναστάντας καταγινώσκειν</span>
			condemn <i>hastily,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Ph.
				2.210
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<i>revolt prematurely,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				2.459e
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
